From: lineage-build <build@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] cancunf: Link libsink-mtk against libaudioclient_shim

Matches the device tree: the blob gains libaudioclient_shim.so as a
needed library (added by build/apply-patches.sh with patchelf), so the
ELF check resolves the old AudioTrack constructor.
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 7a553a4..53dd163 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -50263,6 +50263,7 @@ cc_prebuilt_library_shared {
                 "liblog",
                 "libmedia_omx",
                 "libaudioclient",
+                "libaudioclient_shim",
                 "libc++",
                 "libc",
                 "libm",
